                <head>No. 1541<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Telegram 212 from Jidda, November 9, reported the death of King Ibn Saud and the accession to the throne of
                    Crown Prince Saud. For additional
                    information, see telegram 218 from Jidda, <ref target="#d1458">Document
                        1458</ref>.</p>
            </div>
